<header class="ref-head yr-head"><p class="cty-kicker">Year by year · <a href="/centuries/19th-century">19th century</a></p><h1 class="research-title">1825</h1><p class="ref-lede">1825 in world history: 20 events, 15 births, 21 deaths, 1 work, 2 states founded and 6 that came to an end. 1,088 recorded states existed that year.</p></header>
